Data sources (web parity), all bound through ChargingListPageModel (no networking in the view, ADR-004):
  useChargingSessionsPaginated -> GET /charging?vehicle_id&start&end   (loadSessions)
  useChargingOptimizer         -> GET /analytics/charging-optimizer     (loadOptimizer)
  useBulkDeleteCharging        -> DELETE /charging/bulk                 (bulkDelete)
SI discipline: energy stays Wh, power W on the wire/model; kWh/kW/currency/duration format only at the
  render boundary via ChargingListFormat; cost applies settings.currency_symbol (web useFormatting().formatCurrency).

NAME-COLLISION RESOLUTION (no silent drift): the codebase already defines `ChargingOptimizer`
  (TeslaSync/feature-views/OptimizerSection.Adapter.swift) and `ChargingStrings`
  (TeslaSync/feature-views/ChargingSection.Model.swift). To avoid an ambiguous-type build break,
  this page's equivalents are named `ChargingListOptimizer` + `ChargingListStrings`.

